{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["end",["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"day1":[["^Hana. Jen Hana. Nemáte tu místo u kamen? Celá se třesu. ","#","^reveal:name","/#","\n","ev","str","^Sedněte si. Co se vám stalo?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Kamna jsou pro hosty, kteří platí.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Byla jsem včera u mostu. Když praskl. ","#","^quest:bridge ","/#","#","^aff:self:+1","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Zaplatím. Mám pár grošů. ","#","^aff:self:-2 ","/#","#","^stress:+1","/#","\n","^Byla jsem u mostu, když praskl. ","#","^quest:bridge","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["^Všichni teď říkají, že to Lukovina nechala shnít. Že mostný nic nedělal.","\n","^To není pravda. Lana jsme natírali dehtem každé jaro. ","#","^cut ","/#","#","^quest:bridge","/#","\n","ev","str","^Kdo jste, Hano? Odkud jste?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},"ev","str","^Věřím vám. Co jste viděla?","/str",{"VAR?":"stress"},6,"<","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":21},"ev","str","^Noviny píšou něco jiného.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":20},{"c-2":["\n",{"->":"day1.who"},{"#f":5}],"c-3":["\n",{"->":"day1.saw"},{"#f":5}],"c-4":["\n","^Noviny nebyly u mostu. Já ano. ","#","^aff:self:-1 ","/#","#","^stress:+1","/#","\n",{"->":"day1.partial"},{"#f":5}]}]}],{"who":["^Jsem dcera mostného. Z Lukoviny. Teď víte, proč se bojím. ","#","^reveal:faction ","/#","#","^aff:self:+1 ","/#","#","^stress:+1","/#","\n",{"->":"day1.saw"},null],"saw":["^Lano nepřetrhla voda ani sekera. Bylo nařezané pilou – rovně, do půlky. Viděla jsem ten řez. ","#","^cut:bridge_cause:sawn ","/#","#","^quest:bridge ","/#","#","^aff:self:+1","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"told_saw","re":true},"^A v noci předtím svítila lucerna dole u převozu. Převozník nikdy nesvítí, olej je drahý. ","#","^cut ","/#","#","^quest:bridge","/#","\n",{"->":"day1.ask"},null],"partial":["^Lano… bylo divné. Víc vám neřeknu, dokud nebudu vědět, komu to řeknete. ","#","^cut ","/#","#","^quest:bridge","/#","\n",{"->":"day1.ask"},null],"ask":[["ev","str","^Řeknu to, komu bude potřeba.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Zůstane to mezi námi.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Tak to radši nikomu. Zatím. ","#","^aff:self:-1 ","/#","#","^stress:+1","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Děkuju. Potřebuju se dneska vyspat pod střechou. ","#","^aff:self:+2 ","/#","#","^aff:k3:+1 ","/#","#","^stress:-1","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["end",null]}],null]}],"followup_day2":[["^Nemohla jsem spát. Ráno jsem šla k mostu – k tomu, co z něj zbylo. ","#","^quest:bridge","/#","\n","^Přinesla jsem kus lana. Podívejte se na ten řez: rovný, čistý. A v něm uvízlé zuby z pily.","\n","^Takovou pilu má jen dílna u převozu. Pan Šebor si ji nechal kovat v Kamenci. ","#","^cut:bridge_cause:ferry_saw ","/#","#","^quest:bridge","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"gave_ferry_saw","re":true},"ev","str","^Musíte to říct kapitánovi z Kamence. Je tady.","/str",{"VAR?":"aff_bertold"},-99,">","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":21},"ev","str","^Schovejte to. Ještě nevíme, komu věřit.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Šebor? Ten z převozu? To je vážné obvinění.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Kapitánovi? Ten mě zavře dřív, než dořeknu větu. ","#","^stress:+1","/#","\n","^Ale dobře. Když u toho budete vy. ","#","^aff:self:+1 ","/#","#","^aff:bertold:+1","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"will_testify","re":true},{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Schovám. Ale dlouho to neudržím. Šebor ví, že jsem tam byla. ","#","^aff:self:+1 ","/#","#","^stress:+1","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","^Já vím. Proto to říkám jen vám. ","#","^aff:self:-1","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["^Jestli se mi něco stane, hostinský… ten kus lana je pod mou postelí. ","#","^cut ","/#","#","^quest:bridge","/#","\n","end",null]}],null],"followup_day2_quiet":[["^Ještě jsem tady. Nevěděla jsem, kam jít. ","#","^quest:bridge","/#","\n","^Včera jsem vám neřekla všechno. Lano bylo nařezané. Pilou. ","#","^cut:bridge_cause:sawn ","/#","#","^quest:bridge","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"told_saw","re":true},"ev","str","^Proč jste to neřekla hned?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Děkuju, že to říkáte teď.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Protože jste se tvářil, jako byste mi nevěřil. ","#","^aff:self:-1 ","/#","#","^stress:+1","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Někomu jsem to říct musela. ","#","^aff:self:+2","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["^Dneska jdu domů. Přes převoz. Jiná cesta není. ","#","^stress:+1","/#","\n","end",null]}],null],"followup_day3":[["^Dneska jsem poprvé spala celou noc. ","#","^aff:self:+1","/#","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"will_testify"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ Kapitán si ode mě vzal ten kus lana. Prý se podívá do dílny u převozu.",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"gave_ferry_saw"},false,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Ještě jedna věc… ty zuby v řezu. Takovou pilu má jen dílna u převozu. ","#","^cut:bridge_cause:ferry_saw ","/#","#","^quest:bridge","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"gave_ferry_saw","re":true},{"->":".^.^.^.17"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Šebor má prý dneska přijít sem. Platí tu vždycky stříbrem – kamenckým. ","#","^cut ","/#","#","^quest:bridge","/#","\n","ev","str","^Pomůžete mi ho usvědčit?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Měla byste odejít, než přijde.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Když budete chtít, budu stát vedle vás. ","#","^aff:self:+2 ","/#","#","^aff:k3:+1","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"stands_with_you","re":true},{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Máte pravdu. Ale už nechci utíkat. ","#","^aff:self:+1 ","/#","#","^stress:+1","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["end",null]}],null],"global decl":["ev",0,{"VAR=":"stress"},0,{"VAR=":"aff_self"